  "subdivision_of_building": "Basement and Lower Ground Floor Flat – Front, Side and Rear Elevations\n\nThe proposed works affect the self-contained basement/lower ground floor flat within a converted Victorian terrace. The replacement windows include:\n- A bay window spanning two storeys at the front (basement + lower ground levels)\n- Three arched sash windows at the front on the lower ground floor level\n- A side casement window\n- Two sash windows at the rear elevation\n\nThese windows serve only the lower flat and do not affect the flat above. The works do not alter the structure or appearance of the rest of the building.",
